            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "N. Joanne"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I get Rosa's beef fajitas at least once a month; they are addicting. Something is missing in this marinade - it is just NOT the same at all.",
            "datePublished": "2026-08-20T22:33:42.912Z"
          },
          {
